SUMMARY:Closure: ARSENAL STATION: Arsenal station is closed due to 
 infrastructure damage within the station. We are assessing the problem and
  will work to reopen the station as quickly as possible. While this 
 station is closed\, you are advised to use local buses and alternative 
 nearby stations including Finsbury Park\, Holloway Road or Highbury & 
 Islington.
